  m_Name: MCQ_001
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MCQQuestionData
  questionText: Which of these is excluded from the movement area?
  referenceImage: {fileID: 0}
  explanationText: The movement area is the manoeuvring area, the aprons and any
    part provided for aircraft maintenance. Buildings are not part of it.
  options:
  - Buildings and other constructed facilities
  - The apron
  - Grass areas specified for aircraft use
  - Areas provided for aircraft maintenance
  correctOptionIndex: 0
